1
00:00:03,228 --> 00:00:07,106
Give each agent their queues under Agent entitlements.

2
00:00:07,106 --> 00:00:11,758
Open the entitlement of an agent, and add Sales to Allowed queues.

3
00:00:11,758 --> 00:00:16,670
The queue's priority and delay say how the agent backs up other teams.

4
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:20,288
Skills decide who can take work that requires one.

5
00:00:20,748 --> 00:00:25,235
Supervisors see only the queues on their own entitlement record.

6
00:00:25,235 --> 00:00:29,528
An empty live dashboard almost always means a missing record.

